# client-custom-fields.paging-door.must-fail.patch
#
# Targets: AC-34 (the paging door — `useActions().setCriteria` is the
# platform's generic criteria door that lets a consumer set a page size
# despite AC-33's mandatory `pagination.limit.default: 0`).
# Authored by: developer seat (agent-seat-separation.companion.md — the seat
# that knows the exact line it changed authors the mutant; the prover applies
# it blind, confirms RED, then reverts — never reading src to construct it).
#
# Mutates: useClientCustomFields.actions.ts — replaces the published
# `setCriteria: query.setCriteria,` member with a no-op stub
# (`setCriteria: () => {}`). The call still exists on the returned actions
# object (`typeof actions.setCriteria === "function"` still passes), but it
# no longer reaches `query.setCriteria`, so it writes nowhere — the FE-2824
# shape (declared, not delivered) reproduced for this one door.
#
# Expected RED: `client-custom-fields.paging-door.int.test.ts`'s assertion
# that `setCriteria({ pagination: { limit: 5 } })` moves
# `useContext().query.value.pagination.limit` to `5` and the outbound
# request's `limit` param off the declared `0`. The stub swallows the call,
# so both stay at the schema default no matter what a consumer passes.
#
# Apply / verify / revert:
#   git apply <this file>                                    # mutate
#   pnpm --filter @upmind-automation/headless test -- \
#     src/modules/client-custom-fields/__tests__/client-custom-fields.paging-door.int.test.ts
#   git apply -R <this file>                                  # revert — must return to green
#
--- a/packages/headless/src/modules/client-custom-fields/useClientCustomFields.actions.ts
+++ b/packages/headless/src/modules/client-custom-fields/useClientCustomFields.actions.ts
@@ -245,7 +245,7 @@
      * above. This is the door that sets the page size:
      * `setCriteria({ pagination: { limit } })`.
      */
-    setCriteria: query.setCriteria,
+    setCriteria: () => {},

     /** Re-orders the collection — the `sort` branch of the query model. */
     sortBy
